==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|hlýr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*hliwjaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*hlēwaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*hlēwijaz||warm}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*ḱal(w)e-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*ḱel(w)e-}}, {{m|ine-pro|*k(')lēw-||warm, hot}}.

